### Thử API tải CV bằng tiện ích REST Client trong VS Code (nhà phát hành: Huachao Mao)
### Bấm chữ "Send Request" hiện phía trên mỗi khối POST.
### Cổng lấy theo profile "https" trong Properties/launchSettings.json. File mẫu nằm trong thư mục test-files/ ở gốc repo.

@host = https://localhost:7269

### 1) Gửi 1 file PDF
POST {{host}}/api/cvs/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----SmartCvBoundary

------SmartCvBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="cv-mau-1.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ../../test-files/cv-mau-1.pdf
------SmartCvBoundary--

### 2) Gửi 2 file cùng lúc (PDF + PNG)
POST {{host}}/api/cvs/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----SmartCvBoundary

------SmartCvBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="cv-mau-1.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ../../test-files/cv-mau-1.pdf
------SmartCvBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="cv-mau-2.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ../../test-files/cv-mau-2.png
------SmartCvBoundary--

### 3) Không gửi file nào -> phải trả 400 "Chưa chọn file"
POST {{host}}/api/cvs/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----SmartCvBoundary

------SmartCvBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="note"

khong co file
------SmartCvBoundary--

### 4) File sai định dạng (.txt) -> A4 vẫn trả 200, status "Received" (A5 mới từ chối)
POST {{host}}/api/cvs/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----SmartCvBoundary

------SmartCvBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="file-sai-dinh-dang.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

< ../../test-files/file-sai-dinh-dang.txt
------SmartCvBoundary--
